        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**CarGlyph** applies **IconBundles** themes to **CarPlay home and dock icons**. The iPhone SpringBoard is not modified.\n\nInstall theme packs under `/Library/Themes`, pick them in **Settings → CarGlyph**, then reconnect CarPlay (or tap **Reload CarPlay**).\n\nIf you like CarGlyph, donations via [PayPal](https://www.paypal.me/DevDcsyhi) and follows on [X](https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=linux_n1) are appreciated.",
